{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Slenderman: Unbecoming</u> is a new adaptation on<i> Slenderman</i>, the paranormal phenomenon. Slenderman: Unbecoming is a single-player horror game, based on the narrative of a Regional Park ranger and his community, being haunted. Play intense missions, play your way through the story, and stay Sane. Play uniquely with user-driven choices that alter your outcomes.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Will You Do? How Will You Survive? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror Elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard, Mouse &amp; Controller supported</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the wrong decision, and you may pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Survival is up to you. </strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1719420?t=1758336196","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1719420?t=1758336196","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1719420/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758336196","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1719420/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758336196","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Slenderman: Unbecoming</u> is a new adaptation on<i> Slenderman</i>, the paranormal phenomenon. Slenderman: Unbecoming is a single-player horror game, based on the narrative of a Regional Park ranger and his community, being haunted. Play intense missions, play your way through the story, and stay Sane. Play uniquely with user-driven choices that alter your outcomes.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Will You Do? How Will You Survive? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror Elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard, Mouse &amp; Controller supported</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the wrong decision, and you may pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Survival is up to you. </strong></p>","developers":["FOLIO DIGITAL"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1719420/header.jpg?t=1758336196","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Folio Digital 2021","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257196997,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196997/movie480.mp4?t=1757706571","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196997/movie_max.mp4?t=1757706571"},"name":"Slenderman: Unbecoming","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257196997/69fb9b9ddab694ab86671101591b1b940c46bfe8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757706571","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196997/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757706571","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196997/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757706571"}}],"name":"Slenderman: Unbecoming","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["FOLIO INTERACTIVE"],"ratings":null,"release_dat